get_embeddings.py runs each string in responses_flat through bert and puts the embeddings in the bert_embeddings.npz file.

our_model.py is the code for the fully connected model that trains on the bert embedding data

json_viewer is used for viewing the data and checking the format of the large json files.


realflattener.py and shrinkcomments.py were generated using chatGPT and just serve to format our data in a way that's 
conducive to putting through the bert embeddings.